# Auto detect text files and perform LF normalization
* text=auto

# Retro style files carry byte offsets in their .rolemap siblings: TRetroSkins
# rejects a style whose size disagrees with the map, and every skin patches
# colors at a recorded offset. Line-ending translation shifts every one of
# those offsets, so these must reach disk byte-for-byte on every platform --
# normalization is what makes all 221 skins unusable outside Windows.
*.style -text
